---
import '../styles/components/symbols.css';
import '../styles/components/CapabilityCards.css';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import products from '../data/products.json';
---
<div class="capability-cards"><a class="capability-card capability-path reveal" href="/products/attack-paths/"><div class="capability-card-head"><span class="product-symbol"><Icon name="route" size={26}/></span><Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={23}/></div><h3>Find the path<br/>behind the finding.</h3><p>{products[0].summary}</p><div class="capability-network" aria-hidden="true"><span class="net-node net-1"><Icon name="cloud" size={28}/></span><span class="net-node net-2"><Icon name="key" size={28}/></span><span class="net-node net-3"><Icon name="database" size={28}/></span><span class="net-node net-4"><Icon name="code" size={18}/></span><span class="net-node net-5"><Icon name="users" size={18}/></span><svg viewBox="0 0 440 180"><path d="M60 100 200 40 360 100 M60 100 120 165 200 40 M200 40 285 160 360 100"/><path class="active" d="M60 100 200 40 360 100"/><circle class="flow-packet" r="4"><animateMotion dur="4s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M60 100 200 40 360 100"/></circle></svg></div><span class="text-link">Attack path analysis<Icon name="arrow-right" size={16}/></span></a><a class="capability-card capability-identity reveal" href="/products/identity-security/"><div class="capability-card-head"><span class="product-symbol"><Icon name="fingerprint" size={26}/></span><Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={23}/></div><h3>Every identity.<br/>Its real access.</h3><p>{products[1].summary}</p><div class="permission-stack" aria-hidden="true"><div><Icon name="user" size={17}/><span>Human identities</span><Icon name="check" size={15}/></div><div><Icon name="cpu" size={17}/><span>Workload identities</span><Icon name="check" size={15}/></div><div><Icon name="git-branch" size={17}/><span>Automation roles</span><Icon name="arrow-right" size={15}/></div></div><span class="text-link">Identity security<Icon name="arrow-right" size={16}/></span></a><a class="capability-card capability-posture reveal" href="/products/cloud-posture/"><div class="capability-card-head"><span class="product-symbol"><Icon name="cloud" size={26}/></span><Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={23}/></div><h3>Your cloud.<br/>With direction.</h3><p>{products[2].summary}</p><div class="posture-preview" aria-hidden="true"><div><span class="check-tile"><Icon name="check" size={21}/></span><span class="check-tile"><Icon name="check" size={21}/></span><span class="check-tile review"><Icon name="eye" size={21}/></span></div><span>Evidence. Ownership. Verification.</span></div><span class="text-link">Cloud security posture<Icon name="arrow-right" size={16}/></span></a></div>
